; Last Hero — Act 1, joint 2 (docs/plan/2026-10-15-act1.md): the capital.
;
; Its own small map rather than the open world's Poytaxt: the world is Act 2's, and a whole open
; world is a heavy thing to lay for three conversations. In by the south gate; the square with the
; merchant and two townsfolk who ask small things of him; north up the steps to the castle court,
; where the queen sits; east down to the blacksmith's cellar. The hero leaves by the gate he came
; in by — to the training, and later to the war. Castle and town pieces (FelikinRuslan, CC BY 4.0)
; stand on the stone round the rooms.

